        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n        Esek 2:8—3:3\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo ishiwi nacumfwa ukufuma ku mulu lyanjeba nakabili aliti, “Kabiye kabule akatabo akakupukulwa akali mu minwe yakwa malaika uunyantile ulukasa lumo pali bemba no lubiye pa mulundu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awe naima naya kuli malaika namulomba ukuti ampeele akatabo. Nao anjeba ati, “Kabule, ukalye. Mu kanwa mwena kalelowa kwati buci, lelo mu mala kalelula.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awe napoka akatabo kuli malaika, nalya no kulya. Mu kanwa kaumfwika akalowa kwati buci, lelo lilya nakamina mu mala yandi mwena kayaluka, kalula nganshi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
